@startuml
actor User as 用户
participant "前端" as Web
participant "后端服务" as Server
participant "平台" as Douyin

用户 -> Web: 点击登录
Web -> Server: GET /api/douyin/auth
Server --> Web: 返回302重定向
Web -> Douyin: 自动跳转授权页面
用户 -> Douyin: 输入账号密码授权
Douyin --> Web: 302回调到/api/douyin/callback?code=xxx
Web -> Server: GET /api/douyin/callback
Server -> Douyin: POST 用code换取access_token
Douyin --> Server: 返回access_token和openid
Server -> Douyin: GET 获取用户信息
Douyin --> Server: 返回用户基本信息
Server -> Server: 加密存储用户信息
Server --> Web: 返回登录成功响应
@enduml